@startuml
title Daily task completion rewards (DEV, 2026-10-11)
actor Learner
participant Web
participant Backend
database "product_gotit" as DB
Learner -> Web: Complete lesson/conversation or article quiz
Web -> Backend: Existing completion request
Backend -> DB: Begin transaction; scoped practice-user lock
Backend -> Backend: Verify completion evidence/category
alt Qualifying completion
  Backend -> DB: Insert unique daily-task ledger key
  alt First task completion today
    Backend -> DB: Add fixed XP to total/level and daily projection
  else Already earned
    DB --> Backend: No additional reward
  end
end
Backend -> DB: Persist completion; commit
Backend --> Web: Existing completion response
Web -> Backend: Reload dashboard
Backend -> DB: Read task amounts and daily keys
Backend --> Web: dailyTaskRewards {xp, completed}
Web --> Learner: Numeric XP badge; check when earned
@enduml
